   "seg_dur": 5.645,
   "timing": [
    {
     "text": "Friends brought a blind man to Jesus in Bethsaida and begged Him just to touch him.",
     "start": 0.0,
     "end": 5.016
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": "n1a",
   "v1_still": "s2-taken-by-the-hand.jpeg",
   "zoom": "in",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "-20%",
   "seg_start": 5.645,
   "audio_start": 5.925,
   "spoken_end": 8.852,
   "seg_end": 9.572,
   "audio_dur": 3.291,
   "spoken_dur": 2.927,
   "seg_dur": 3.927,
   "timing": [
    {
     "text": "Jesus took the man by the hand and walked him outside the village.",
     "start": 0.0,
     "end": 3.251
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": "n1b",
   "v1_still": "s3-the-first-touch.jpeg",
   "zoom": "in",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "-20%",
   "seg_start": 9.572,
   "audio_start": 9.852,
   "spoken_end": 14.629,
   "seg_end": 15.349,
   "audio_dur": 5.251,
   "spoken_dur": 4.777,
   "seg_dur": 5.777,
   "timing": [
    {
     "text": "He spit on the man's eyes and laid His hands on him, then asked if he could see anything yet.",
     "start": 0.0,
     "end": 5.201
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": "n2",
   "v1_still": "s4-men-as-trees-walking.jpeg",
   "zoom": "in",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "-20%",
   "seg_start": 15.349,
   "audio_start": 15.629,
   "spoken_end": 28.085,
   "seg_end": 28.805,
   "audio_dur": 12.8,
   "spoken_dur": 12.456,
   "seg_dur": 13.456,
   "timing": [
    {
     "text": "The man looked up and said the strangest thing \u2014 he could see, but only halfway.",
     "start": 0.0,
     "end": 4.505
    },
    {
     "text": "People looked like trees walking around.",
     "start": 4.505,
     "end": 7.129
    },
    {
     "text": "His first glimpse was real, but unfinished.",
     "start": 7.129,
     "end": 9.822
    },
    {
     "text": "Jesus did not scold him for saying so.",
     "start": 9.822,
     "end": 12.771
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": "n3",
   "v1_still": "s5-the-second-touch.jpeg",
   "zoom": "in",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "-20%",
   "seg_start": 28.805,
   "audio_start": 29.085,
   "spoken_end": 33.45,
   "seg_end": 34.17,
   "audio_dur": 4.78,
   "spoken_dur": 4.366,
   "seg_dur": 5.366,
   "timing": [
    {
     "text": "So Jesus put His hands on the man's eyes a second time and told him to look up again.",
     "start": 0.0,
     "end": 4.737
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "seg": "n4",
   "v1_still": "s6-every-face-every-leaf.jpeg",
   "zoom": "in",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "-20%",
   "seg_start": 34.17,
   "audio_start": 34.45,
   "spoken_end": 50.742,
   "seg_end": 51.462,
   "audio_dur": 16.744,
   "spoken_dur": 16.292,
   "seg_dur": 17.292,
   "timing": [
    {
     "text": "And this time he saw everything clearly \u2014 every face, every leaf.",
     "start": 0.0,
     "end": 4.772
    },
    {
     "text": "The second touch finished what the first had started.",
     "start": 4.772,
     "end": 8.092
    },
    {
     "text": "The story never explains why healing came in stages.",
     "start": 8.092,
     "end": 11.912
    },
    {
     "text": "It simply shows that an unfinished beginning was not the end.",
     "start": 11.912,
     "end": 16.718
    }
   ]
  },
  {
